{"ref":"BDB, זָנַח","hw":"זָנַח","html":"† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">זָנַח</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. reject, spurn (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">زَنَحَ</span> <em>repelled</em>; Assyrian <em>zinû</em>, <em>to be angry</em> not connected<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:3\" href=\"/Hosea.8.3\">Ho 8:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:5\" href=\"/Hosea.8.5\">5</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:7\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.7\">La 2:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זָנַחְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:10\" href=\"/Psalms.44.10\">ψ 44:10</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנַחְתָּ֑נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 43:2\" href=\"/Psalms.43.2\">ψ 43:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנַחְתָּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:3\" href=\"/Psalms.60.3\">ψ 60:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:12\" href=\"/Psalms.60.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:12\" href=\"/Psalms.108.12\">108:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">זְנַחְתִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 10:6\" href=\"/Zechariah.10.6\">Zc 10:6</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִזְנַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:8\" href=\"/Psalms.77.8\">ψ 77:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:31\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.31\">La 3:31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּזְנַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:24\" href=\"/Psalms.44.24\">ψ 44:24</a> + 2 times;—<em>reject</em>, Isr. rejects good <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:3\" href=\"/Hosea.8.3\">Ho 8:3</a>; Samaria’s calf rejects her <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:5\" href=\"/Hosea.8.5\">Ho 8:5</a> (others make <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> subj.; We<sup>Kl. Proph.</sup> reads <span dir=\"rtl\">אזנח</span> <em>I reject</em>), elsewhere God rejects people <a data-ref=\"Psalms 43:2\" href=\"/Psalms.43.2\">ψ 43:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:3\" href=\"/Psalms.60.3\">60:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:8\" href=\"/Psalms.77.8\">77:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:15\" href=\"/Psalms.88.15\">88:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 10:6\" href=\"/Zechariah.10.6\">Zc 10:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לָנֶצַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:24\" href=\"/Psalms.44.24\">ψ 44:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:1\" href=\"/Psalms.74.1\">74:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לעולם</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:31\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.31\">La 3:31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ ולא תצא בצבאתינו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:10\" href=\"/Psalms.44.10\">ψ 44:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:12\" href=\"/Psalms.60.12\">60:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:12\" href=\"/Psalms.108.12\">108:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַפְשִׁי מִשָּׁלוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.17\">La 3:17</a>; king <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:39\" href=\"/Psalms.89.39\">ψ 89:39</a>; altar <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:7\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.7\">La 2:7</a>.<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִזְנִיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.19\">2 Ch 29:19</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִזְנִיחָם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.14\">2 Ch 11:14</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶאֶזְנִיחוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.6\">Is 19:6</a>, v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, זָנַח²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_זָנַח²\">II. זנח</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַזְנִיחֲךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.9\">1 Ch 28:9</a>;—(late) <em>reject</em> (= earlier <strong>Qal</strong>), Jeroboam <em>rejects</em> the Levites <span dir=\"rtl\">מכהן לי׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.14\">2 Ch 11:14</a>; Ahaz the sacred vessels <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.19\">2 Ch 29:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> rejects Solomon <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.9\">1 Ch 28:9</a>.","next":"BDB, זָנַח²","prev":"BDB, תַּזְנוּת"}